From 67c6e4be729765af8198e903dc5252cacdf8d090 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: waydroid-nvidia-prolapse <build@local>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:33:08 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 13/25] hwcomposer: present the client target to a compositor
 on another GPU through a system-memory LINEAR copy
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

What: bind zwp_linux_dmabuf_v1 at min(version, 4) and read the default
dma-buf feedback (format table + tranches replace the v3 format/modifier
events; main_device / tranche target_device name the compositor's GPU).
decide_present_path() compares those dev_ts with the guest's nvidia-drm
render node (and its primary node from sysfs): the first tranche listing
ABGR8888/XBGR8888 decides, target == NVIDIA -> same-GPU direct, target ==
main device (another GPU) -> cross-GPU copy. The decision is logged
("present path: ...", and once per change at the first client-target
frame) and exported as waydroid.hwc.present_path = direct|cross-gpu-copy.
In cross-GPU mode:
- the client target (FBT) is imported into Vulkan (prime-copy.cpp: the
  guest's libvulkan, dlopened only in this mode; NVIDIA device, dma-buf
  import with VK_EXT_image_drm_format_modifier) and, after its acquire
  fence, copied with vkCmdCopyImageToBuffer into a target buffer from a
  HOST_VISIBLE, non-DEVICE_LOCAL memory type (system memory), pitch =
  align(width*bpp, 256), size = align(pitch*height, 4096), offset 0,
  exported as a dma-buf and attached with DRM_FORMAT_MOD_LINEAR. The
  commit waits for the copy on the CPU; targets are reused after
  wl_buffer.release (pool of up to 4, then a 100 ms wait, then the oldest
  with an error log).
- compositor_supports() refuses every layer buffer, so all other layers
  are composed by SurfaceFlinger (or go through the existing wl_shm
  backstop in multi-window mode / for the cursor).
- a failed copy is not presented (logged), never the block-linear original.

Why: baseline issue #2. A compositor on an Intel/AMD iGPU cannot import
NVIDIA block-linear buffers; the FBT is exempt from the displayable gate
and was create_immed'd anyway -> zwp_linux_buffer_params error 7 -> the
Wayland connection dies -> hwc exits 75 -> SurfaceFlinger aborts.
Advertised LINEAR does not help with gralloc buffers either: they live in
NVIDIA video memory, and nvidia-drm exports NVKMS video memory without
pages (nvidia-drm-gem-nvkms-memory.c __nv_drm_gem_nvkms_memory_prime_
get_sg_table: pages_count == 0 -> -ENOMEM), so a foreign attach fails.
Reproduced and verified with a virtual KWin rendering on the AMD iGPU
(before: error 7 + hwc exit 75 + SF tombstone; after: Launcher and
Settings render, no errors, no dma-buf attach failure in the kernel log).

Source: ours. The recipe is NVIDIA's own driver behaviour in the same
situation, observed with the stock Vulkan driver (vkcube --wsi wayland on
the NVIDIA GPU against a KWin rendering on the AMD iGPU, WAYLAND_DEBUG +
strace): it requests per-surface dma-buf feedback and presents 500x500
XR24 images as zwp_linux_buffer_params add(fd, plane 0, offset 0, stride
2048, modifier 0) = LINEAR with the pitch aligned to 256 bytes. Its
public EGL analogue is egl-wayland2 1.0.2 (src/wayland/wayland-display.c
force_prime when the render device differs from the server device;
src/wayland/wayland-swapchain.c LINEAR present buffers allocated with
force_sysmem = prime, copied after rendering).
Licence: Apache-2.0 (android_hardware_waydroid).
Deviation from the stock recipe: default feedback instead of per-surface
feedback; no tranche for either GPU -> decided by the main device
(stock fails the swapchain); copy on the device's single NVK queue family
(NVK exposes no transfer-only family; its copies use the copy-engine class
on that channel); system memory is NVK's cached+snooped type (stock uses
write-combined); no wp_linux_drm_syncobj explicit sync (stock's fallback
path: CPU wait + wl_buffer.release); compositors with dma-buf < v4 keep
the direct path (logged; stock falls back to wl_drm's device).

补丁含无法重建的旧 blob 标识，git am -3 后以拒绝块逐段移植。dmabuf v4 feedback、present_path、复制池均迁至 wl_conn，FBT 保留 shared_ptr；连接销毁或重连先释放源与复制池，避免借用旧连接代理。新增适配 ATV task streams：有 android_wlegl 时保留原路径，否则按当前连接使用 dmabuf，同 GPU 直传、跨 GPU PRIME；接回 slot release 回调，保留各任务连接及原有 fence/快照/配置时序。

